{
  "$spec": "SPEC.md §4.8",
  "description": "Resolve a recipient's send-window zone. A valid mapped zone wins, then the country's representative zone, then the Settings fallback (Asia/Kolkata here). An invalid mapped zone is ignored with warning INVALID_TIME_ZONE.",
